      "optionNotes": ["Wrong: left mini-grid is [white, white, black, white] in reading order; it should be [white, white, white, black] in reading order; bottom arrow is 90° clockwise from up; it should be 270° clockwise from up.","Correct: left mini-grid: [white, white, white, black] in reading order; middle mini-grid: [black, white, black, white] in reading order; right mini-grid: [black, white, black, black] in reading order; bottom arrow: 270° clockwise from up.","Wrong: right mini-grid is [black, white, white, white] in reading order; it should be [black, white, black, black] in reading order.","Wrong: left mini-grid is [white, black, black, black] in reading order; it should be [white, white, white, black] in reading order; middle mini-grid is [white, black, white, white] in reading order; it should be [black, white, black, white] in reading order.","Wrong: left mini-grid is [black, black, white, white] in reading order; it should be [white, white, white, black] in reading order; middle mini-grid is [white, black, white, white] in reading order; it should be [black, white, black, white] in reading order."],
