      "solution": ["Outer quadrants: each pattern moves one quadrant anticlockwise per step. Next: top-left vertical stripes, top-right chequers, bottom-right white, bottom-left horizontal stripes.","Inner circle: the black segment stays lower-right; the other three patterns move one segment clockwise among the remaining segments. Next: upper-right vertical stripes, lower-right black, lower-left chequers, upper-left dots.","Centre square: grey → white → grey → white → grey. Next: white."],
